				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=6707">shadowsep</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">6/24/2003 - 8:50 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=5823">Tramir Soulclaimer</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Ok,from what I gather, July 12th is a good day for most of you. I've been thinking about what I want to talk about, and I've come up with a few things.....<br />
<br />
1. Balance seems to be our only real defecit right now in the guild. I'm happy to report that we're taking care of the problem nicely. We have Raile's new bard apprentice, and I'm working on grabbing up two Clerics for us. I know that Zo is busy scourng the land as well, and the Boss mentioned something about having a possible lead too. GOOD JOB guys!!<br />
<br />
2. I want to stress that this meeting is going to be nothing like that last one...all uptight and such. I want to keep this one loose, and fun. Think of it more as a social than a meeting. We can even have prizes to give away. Let's try and think of some contests or silly things we can do. One thing that came to me is Drunken Dueling!! We each get sloshed, and then duel. Prizes can be given to whoever maanges to win or something. Just an idea.<br />
<br />
3. I like the Boss's idea of having a weekly PL session for our younger players. This gives us a chance to groom them in the ways of group fighting and gives a shot at getting to become closer with our newbies.<br />
<br />
4. For us dinosaurs of the guild, I'd like to maybe try and get some raiding going. Anywhere is cool, but I'm gonna be a bitch and plug myself here....can we do Kael yet? LoL....I want to get some Corroded Armor drops off the giants so that I can do the Champion armor quests for the Coldain. Again, just an idea.<br />
<br />
Ok....I've rambled on enough, let me know if my ideas are good, or just rubbish. I won't be offended if you guys think I'm way off base. I've been wrong once or twice in my life....I think? LoL.<br />
<br />
Tramir Soulclaimer<br />
Human Warrior Meatshield of 41 Killing Blows<br />
Knighs of the Ebon Killers, er, WOLVES						</td>
