					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Yes Sav, Kael is in Velious. But, I want to stress this...It's not a place to have a picnic. FOW raids it every Wednesday, and I haven't been able to tag along yet. Something kept coming up to prevent it...like WORK!! Yuck.<br />
<br />
Just make sure you're fully buffed, and have LoH up. To put it in perspective for you, Kael Drakkal makes Sol B look like a walk in the park. There's like 15 named Giants, and a whole host of Frost and Storm giants thrown in for good measure. But, if we can get the Boss, Nam, and especially MED along, we should do nicely there. I won't even bother to ask Zo and kaay....they'll go anywhere I ask them to. GREAT allies they are.						</td>
